OL,3,GNEWSAMP calls for tougher laws to
OL,4,Atackle illegal e-bikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has called for tougher
OL,7,Flegislation against the illegal use of
OL,8,Fe-bikes and e-scooters.
OL,10,FHelen Maguire, who represents Epsom and
OL,11,FEwell, said the issue had been a
OL,12,F"challenge" for her constituency, with
OL,13,Fresidents reporting "deep concerns".
OL,15,FShe said: "There is no national
OL,16,Fstrategy for tackling illegally
OL,17,Fmodified e-bikes and e-scooters, and
OL,18,Fpolice are having to rely on laws not
OL,19,Fdesigned for the problem."
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
