OL,3,GNEWSAMP calls for tougher laws to
OL,4,Atackle illegal e-bikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Department for Transport (DfT)
OL,7,Fspokesperson said: "Modified e-bikes
OL,8,Fthat exceed legal power or speed limits
OL,9,Fare effectively motorbikes and should
OL,10,Fnot be on the roads unless they are
OL,11,Fregistered, taxed and insured."
